cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Reproduction Code and Data for “Cycles with Exactly Two Amplifications in GCD-Augmented Fibonacci Recurrences”"
authors:
  - family-names: Hawarey
    given-names: Mosab
    affiliation: Geospatial Research
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mhawarey/two-amplification-cycles-gcd-fibonacci"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for the paper "Cycles with Exactly Two Amplifications in
  GCD-Augmented Fibonacci Recurrences" by Mosab Hawarey (2026). The script
  verifies the known cycles of the cofactor map with exactly two
  amplifications (the thirteen of Table 1 and the twelve of Proposition 17)
  from their defining triples, and reproduces the residue
  covering modulo 2, 3, 5 and 7, the census of all patterns with cycle
  multiplier L_q, the exclusion of cycles with G > L_q for periods up to 36,
  and the census of small seeds. Version 1.1.0 adds the factorizations of the
  Lucas numbers used in the paper, with every prime factor proved prime, and
  the thirteen cycles in full.
keywords:
  - gcd-augmented Fibonacci recurrence
  - cofactor map
  - cycles
  - Lucas numbers
  - Collatz-type cycles
